OL,3,GNEWSANo plans to scrap minimum wage,
OL,4,Asays chief minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe minister's comments followed calls
OL,7,Fto scrap the minimum wage from an
OL,8,Feconomist and Value Jersey board member
OL,9,FDouglas Kruger. Deputy Voisin endorsed
OL,10,Fthe political movement Value Jersey in
OL,11,Fthe election.
OL,13,FIn a statement, Farnham said Voisin's
OL,14,Fletter reflected his personal views and
OL,15,Fshould not be seen as the position of
OL,16,Fthe Council of Ministers or States
OL,17,FAssembly.
